    "final": "I opened and checked all 45 tee listings in the search results (36 on page 1, 9 on page 2; every result was a Quenby tee, so no non-tee listings were skipped). On each one I selected size M and read the resulting price and availability; only listings whose M size was actually selectable/in stock (not disabled, Add to Cart active) count as able to supply size M. Excluded on those grounds: Pembroke Threads ($10.72, M disabled), Ashgrove Clothing Co ($10.20, no M), Fairhaven-like cheap teasers Oakfield ($13.60, M disabled), Copperfield ($14.45, M disabled), Thornbury ($12.66, M disabled), Redhill ($18.83, M disabled), Fordwich ($11.23, no M), Holbeck ($19.17, M disabled), etc. The three cheapest sellers that can actually supply size M are:\n1) Gisburn Clothing Co - $12.58 (size M, in stock)\n2) Fairhaven Outfitters - $13.95 (size M \"Only 1 left!\", in stock)\n3) Garrick Workwear Supply Co - $15.33 (size M, in stock)\nPer-size price verification on these three confirmed the M-specific prices (e.g., Gisburn M=$12.58 vs XL=$16.09; Fairhaven M=$13.95 vs L=$11.13). The next-cheapest M-capable listing is Hillside Garment Works at $17.39.",
